  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1011.01 Change of Address. Within 30 days of changing legal address, mailing address, or both, a licensee shall complete and submit form DSMV 30 “Record Change Request” (rev. 06/23) to the division:\n\nSource. #8109, eff 6-24-04; ss by #10176, eff 8-23-12 (from Saf-C 1010.01); ss by #13685, eff 8-5-23; ss by #14504, EMERGENCY, eff 2-6-26, EXPIRED: 8-5-26; reverted back to #13685",
